# anbernic tracker song
version 3
bpm 123
ticks 6
meter 4 4
tracks 8
reverb 54 78
swing 54
delay 12 62

inst 00 engine DRUM timbre 0 adsr 0 0 255 16 name KICK
inst 01 engine DRUM timbre 0 adsr 0 0 255 22 name CLAP
inst 02 engine DRUM timbre 0 adsr 0 0 255 5 gain -7 name HATC
inst 03 engine DRUM timbre 0 adsr 0 0 255 30 gain -9 name HATO
inst 04 engine WAVE timbre 0 adsr 0 70 150 12 gain -3 drive 35 filter 130 55 84 92 name BASS
lay 04 engine PULSE timbre 2 transpose -12 gain -6
inst 05 engine PULSE timbre 1 adsr 3 40 70 22 drive 70 filter 160 60 82 96 name STAB
lay 05 engine WAVE timbre 0 detune 9 gain -4
inst 06 engine WAVE timbre 0 adsr 4 60 180 30 drive 50 filter 170 70 86 name LEAD
lay 06 engine WAVE timbre 0 detune -11 gain -3
lay 06 engine PULSE timbre 1 transpose 12 gain -10
inst 07 engine VOX timbre 0 adsr 8 40 210 26 gain 10 drive 45 tract 70 name VOXLEAD
inst 08 engine VOX timbre 0 adsr 10 40 210 30 gain 2 drive 30 name VOXLOW

trk 0 vol 104 pan 0
trk 1 vol 82 pan 0 rev 20
trk 2 vol 60 pan 18 rev 12
trk 3 vol 68 pan 0
trk 4 vol 66 pan -22 rev 16 ech 26
trk 5 vol 70 pan 24 rev 20 ech 32
trk 6 vol 127 pan 0 rev 20 ech 26
trk 7 vol 92 pan 0 rev 22 ech 20

